WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.700
Incoming Lead: A buyer submits a property enquiry through a Meta Ads lead form.

2
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:07.450
AI Calling: The lead enters the platform and the AI agent places a call automatically.

3
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.200
Buyer Conversation: The AI discusses configuration, budget, location and purchase timeline.

4
00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:14.950
Lead Qualification: The conversation becomes structured CRM data with a lead score.

5
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.700
WhatsApp Follow-up: A property brochure follow-up is prepared and sent on WhatsApp.

6
00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:22.450
Site Visit Booking: The buyer picks an available site visit slot.

7
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.200
Sales Team Handover: The qualified buyer is assigned to a sales executive.

8
00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:29.950
Performance Dashboard: The completed workflow appears in the analytics dashboard.
